    "html": "<p>Two stars of equal mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M\"></span> orbit in a binary system around their common center of mass. The radius of the stars' orbits is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R\"></span>. What is the total energy required to separate the stars to infinity?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{GM^2}{2R}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{GM^2}{4R}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2GM^2}R\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{4GM^2}R\"></span></p></li></ol>"
